{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When Hana\u2019s garden of musical flowers are scattered across a sky full of beautiful islands, she must turn to the magical Tempopo for help returning them. Chaotic and uncoordinated by nature, the Tempopo rely on Hana\u2019s conducting skills to keep on the right track, and solve each island's puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/318840/extras/610_tempopo_slide_surfers.gif?t=1745329611\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PUZZLE THROUGH THE SEASONS </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each island is a challenge of planning and execution. Experiment with different configurations and routes, instruct every Tempopo to play their part as they smash, block, lift and push each other through the puzzles that span all four seasons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LET THE MUSIC PLAY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A bright and joyful world that\u2019s permeated with music, where every living element moves in harmony with a rhythmic heartbeat. With a soundtrack by BAFTA award-winning composer &amp; audio director Jeff van Dyck, every note is a joy. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SPACE TO GROW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each puzzle you solve, the flowers you rescue become a part of your very own melodic garden. Each type of flower sings its own tune, and you can synthesize their melodies to enjoy unique musical performances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/318840/extras/610_tempopo_chomper.gif?t=1745329611\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Blooming Roses","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/318840/e28adee05eed988a48d2dedea38a487583c9b6ce.jpg"},{"name":"Dancing Fireflies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/31884